window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Welcome to the Sin City Series, where the glitz and glamour of Las Vegas serve as the backdrop for love, heartbreak, and redemption.</p> <p>Book 1: Exquisitely Broken In a world of wealth and privilege, Sinclair James and her music break through the barriers of class. Jacob Johnson had it all, but one decision shattered their love. Now, destiny brings them back together in a city that never sleeps. Can they mend what was exquisitely broken, or will the bright lights of Vegas cast shadows on their second chance?</p> <p>Book 2: Exquisitely Hidden As the charismatic frontman of the band, secrets threaten to unravel Adam's carefully constructed life. His love for the enigmatic Seth jeopardizes everything he's built. With a heart-wrenching choice ahead, Adam must decide whether to reveal his hidden truth or risk losing the man he's meant to love. Can their connection survive the spotlight's glare?</p> <p>Book 3: Exquisitely Yours Meet Daniel Xu, the carefree playboy whose life is about to take an unexpected turn. When Jessica Johnson enters the picture, everything he thought he knew about himself is called into question. In a city where boundaries are meant to be pushed, Daniel discovers a connection that goes beyond the superficial. Can he convince Jessica to take a chance on a man known for breaking all the rules?</p> <p>In the Sin City Series, love is a gamble, and every roll of the dice brings a new twist. Get ready for a journey of passion, redemption, and the irresistible allure of romance in the city that never sleeps. What happens in Vegas might just change everything.</p>"; 
